== CANON-4: newlines terminate statements, so a `(` that begins a new line does
== not continue the previous line as a call. `(1)` is a separate (invalid)
== statement here, not an argument list for `Report`.
Module Diagnostics.CallParenOnNextLine

Report :
    PutLn(1)
;

Main :
    Report
    (1)
;
